New Pacwyn 20 is here - it's a pack opener game you must to try right now!

A lot of squad building challenges, amazing pack opening system, exclusive objectives - there is everything for you in the game.

Improve your squad day by day, play matches with opponents from over the world and become the best Pacwyn player.

Pacwyn Football Draft and Pack Opener offers:
1. Making collections of football players;
2. Regular pack opening events, including flash and lightning rounds;
3. Joining associations/clans with your friends to become stronger;
4. Building squads and playing online matches against different opponents;
5. Completing Daily and Weekly Objectives to receive awesome rewards;
6. Draft players to try different tactics in your matches;
7. Play Weekend Tournaments to move to TOP 1 in the WorldWide Leaderboard;
8. Trading with others users for more stuff.

Pacwyn 20 has a great community of users, join us right now!

This application’s sole purpose is to help its users learn how to build the best drafts and squads, find out more about football players and updates. This application is not endorsed by or affiliated with Electronic Arts Inc or other incorporations. All trademarks and copyrights belong to their respective owners.

Do you want to know how fast does your car accelerate to 100 km/h?
It’s not a secret, that data of producer is approximate and apply only for ideal conditions. To know the current speed here and now, to make a measure 0-100 km/h, 100-200 km/h, time for ¼ miles ( time of passing 402 meters) will help you the application Test-Drive.
You don’t need any additional devices as RaceLogic, because you already have the accelerometer sensor and GPS sensor in your smartphone. Due to these super sensitive sensors of your iPhone and unique algorithm, we have got am opportunity to measure the time of acceleration of the car to the necessary speed with a high accuracy.
Opportunities of the application:
          - acceleration to 100 km/h;
          - acceleration from 100 to 200 km/h;
          - acceleration to 80 km/h;
          - acceleration from 80 to 120 km/h;
          - time of passing 402 meters and 1000 meters;
          - understandable interface;
          - constant updates and expansion of the functional;
          - the results of the measures save automatically and you can share them with your friends!

Мы добавили в Приложение новый раздел "Споры", надеемся, вам он понравится.
Только, пожалуйста, не путайте ни с тотализатором ни со ставками. Ибо тут вы можете создавать любой предмет спора, все ограниченно только вашей фантазией, а игра идет не на деньги, а на виртуальные очки и не против "конторы", а против конкретных оппонентов.
Это не способ заработка, а попытка развлечь вас при просмотре даже самого скучного матча, из которого можно сделать интереснейший предмет спора.

